  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project for Gender-based Strengthening of the Adolescents&apos; Rights to Education in Three(3) Northern Districts of C te d&apos;Ivoire</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dispatching Korean expertises, Training, Promotion and Awareness-raising, Supplying hardwares, Administrative costs etc.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improve adolescents&apos; health and educational environment in the view of gender-equality centered on Northern regions where ranked poorly in the index of education and health of female adolescents / Provide secondary education which established in the view of gender-equality / Reinforce female/male adolescents&apos; basic health and reproductive health by gender-based approach (Preventing pregenancy and child-birth from ealry marriage, Preventing and Responding against tropical diseases)&#xC0AC;&#xC5C5; &#xC815;&#xCC45;&#xCEE8;&#xC124;&#xD305; &#xC131;&#xACFC; &#xC8FC;&#xC7AC;&#xAD6D; &#xC815;&#xBD80; &#xC815;&#xCC45; &#xBC18;&#xC601;, &#xC9C0;&#xC5ED; &#xB0B4; &#xC5EC;&#xC131; &#xCCAD;&#xC18C;&#xB144; &#xC911;&#xB4F1;&#xD559;&#xAD50; &#xB4F1;&#xB85D;(&#xCDE8;&#xD559;) &#xC778;&#xC6D0; &#xC99D;&#xAC00;, &#xC9C0;&#xC5ED; &#xB0B4; &#xD559;&#xAD50; &#xBC16; &#xCCAD;&#xC18C;&#xB144; &#xAE30;&#xCD08; &#xBB38;&#xD574; &#xBC0F; &#xC218;&#xB9AC; &#xAD50;&#xC721; &#xC774;&#xC218;&#xC728; &#xD5A5;&#xC0C1;, &#xB300;&#xC0C1;&#xD559;&#xAD50; &#xB0B4; &#xC5EC;&#xC131; &#xCCAD;&#xC18C;&#xB144; &#xC911;&#xB4F1; &#xC800;&#xD559;&#xB144;(3&#xAC1C;&#xB144;) &#xACFC;&#xC815; &#xC644;&#xC218; &#xC778;&#xC6D0; &#xC99D;&#xAC00;, &#xB300;&#xC0C1;&#xD559;&#xAD50; &#xB0B4; &#xC5EC;&#xC131; &#xCCAD;&#xC18C;&#xB144; &#xAE30;&#xCD08;&#xAD50;&#xACFC; &#xD559;&#xC5C5;&#xC131;&#xCDE8;&#xB3C4; &#xAC1C;&#xC120; &#xBE44;&#xC728; &#xD5A5;&#xC0C1;</narrative>
